# Copy to .env.local and fill in from your Supabase project:
#   Supabase dashboard → Project Settings → API
#
# Leave BOTH blank (or delete .env.local) to run in demo mode, which keeps
# everything in one browser and is only suitable for trying the app out.
#
# The anon key is a PUBLIC key and is safe to ship in the built app — every
# voter's browser needs it. It grants nothing on its own: RLS in
# supabase/schema.sql is what stops it reading the register or the ballots.
# Never put the service_role key here; it bypasses RLS entirely.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
